# Aggressive Negotiations: "Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it and exile that card. Put a
# +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature you control." Bot1 has a Memnite and an Ornithopter; Bot2 a Memnite of its own.
# On turn 3 Bot1 pays with Black Lotus and targets Bot2 and its own Memnite: the counter is refused for Bot2's Memnite and for
# two creatures at once (up to one), and Bot2's Duress is chosen and exiled (the Island is not offered: nonland only). Bot2's
# Elvish Mystic stays in its hand, and only the Memnite gets the counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Memnite
Ornithopter
Aggressive Negotiations
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Duress
Elvish Mystic
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Aggressive Negotiations.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
! Bot1.Target(Memnite; Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Memnite)
! Bot1.Choose(Island)
Bot1.Choose(Duress)

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Exile = Duress
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Aggressive Negotiations; Black Lotus
Bot2.Revealed = Duress; Elvish Mystic; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
